      556.26,
      297.79,
      639.33
    ],
    "text": "All that Allotment of land described as following name and extent depicted in the Advance Tracing No. MAHA/HRS/2023/368 and dated 30.06.2023 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the village called Attaragama, in Rajapihilla Niladhari Division, No. 463, in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Harispattuwa of Kandy District Central Province and bounded as follows.",
